      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Set your key in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → OpenRouter → OpenRouter settings**.\n2. Type the customer's question in **Customer Question**, and your articles in **Help Articles**, one per line.\n3. Press **Run**. **Reply** shows the answer, or an escalation note."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
