      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Find Relevant Articles** ranks every article against the question and keeps the best three. **Draft the Answer** answers from those three only.\n\nJev checks the draft: **Supported** asks whether every sentence comes from the articles, and **Needs a Person** asks whether a person should handle it. An unsupported draft is replaced by an escalation note.\n\nThree paid requests per run. Prices are in **OpenRouter models**; each request's charge is at openrouter.ai/activity."
      ],
      "title": "Using This Workflow"
    },
